## Installation

Package this plugin and install it via the FreeSDN Marketplace or CLI:

```bash
freesdn-sdk package .
# Upload {plugin_id}-1.0.0.zip via FreeSDN UI or API
```

## Development

```bash
# freesdn-sdk is not on PyPI yet: install it from its release tag, as
# https://github.com/freesdn/freesdn-sdk#install shows.
# pytest-asyncio too: the generated tests are async, and without it pytest
# fails them with "async def functions are not natively supported".
pip install pytest pytest-asyncio
pytest tests/
freesdn-sdk validate .
freesdn-sdk check .
```

`tests/conftest.py` puts this directory on `sys.path` so `from plugin import ...`
resolves. Run `pytest` from the plugin root.

